# 🏥 Healthcare ML & AI Portfolio Dashboard

## 📌 Overview
An intelligent machine learning web application that predicts disease outcomes (Diabetes, Hypertension, Typhoid), analyzes e-commerce customer conversion behaviors, and profiles healthcare/retail datasets with interactive analytics dashboards.

---

## 🚀 Features
- **Interactive ML Predictors**:
  - **Diabetes Risk Assessment**: Live logistic regression model estimating risk probability from clinical markers (Age, BMI, Glucose, Insulin, HbA1c).
  - **Hypertension Classifier**: Random Forest estimator assessing cardiovascular stages (Systolic/Diastolic BP, Heart Rate, BMI).
  - **Typhoid Diagnosis**: Probabilistic inference from fever temperature curves, abdominal symptoms, and Widal test results.
  - **E-Commerce Conversion ML**: Customer purchase intent model based on session duration, browsing depth, and cart abandonment.
- **Dataset Analysis & Upload**:
  - Upload CSV or Excel files (`/api/dataset-summary`) to inspect column dimensions, missing value counts, summary statistics, and data types.
- **Responsive UI & Dark Mode**:
  - Modern dashboard with mobile navigation drawer, theme switching, and interactive Chart.js visualizations.
- **Production Multi-Cloud Deployments**:
  - Ready-to-deploy configurations for **Render**, **AWS** (App Runner / ECS), **Vercel**, and **Netlify**.

---

## 🛠 Tech Stack
- **Backend**: Python 3.12, Flask, Gunicorn
- **Machine Learning & Data**: Scikit-learn, Pandas, NumPy
- **Frontend**: HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript (ES6+), Chart.js
- **Testing**: Pytest
- **Containers & Cloud**: Docker, Render, AWS, Vercel, Netlify

